  "_note": "Virtual models for pi-subscription-router 0.5.0 in ~/.pi/agent. Each profile is a virtual model 'router/<id>'; the SELECTION carries no thinking of its own, every rung states its level explicitly (router returns entry.thinking ?? selected). Rung order mirrors ~/.pi/agent/pi-fallback-chains.json so the router and the fallback extension agree on what 'the opus chain' means. exhaustionPolicy 'wait' parks a dispatch until the next known reset; maxWaitMinutes bounds it so an exhausted chain fails instead of hanging a child forever. CommandCode rungs have no usage endpoint: their reset comes from the 429 body ('limit resets at <ISO>'), which the local patch parses. Manual override after a plan upgrade or a purchased reset: /router reset, then /router refresh.",
